  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Providing Observers for Parliamentary Elections in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Embassy Chisinau seeks to meet the UK&#x2019;s commitment to supporting OSCE/ODIHR election observation by providing Long-term Observers (LTOs) to the OSCE/ODIHR election observation mission (EOM) for the Parliamentary Election in Moldova on 28 September 2025. The main beneficiaries of this work will be OSCE/ODIHR, whose mission will benefit from the expertise of the UK observers, and the Moldovan electorate, whose confidence in the electoral process will be increased by the presence of a strong contingent of international observers.</narrative>
  </description>
